WEBVTT

00:03:26.716 --> 00:03:30.036
We’re going to need
both nature and technology.

00:03:31.196 --> 00:03:32.436
I'll show you what I mean.

00:03:33.076 --> 00:03:36.196
So we start on the natural
end of the spectrum with trees.

00:03:37.196 --> 00:03:39.316
Now, I still find it astonishing

00:03:39.316 --> 00:03:43.196
that every single tree and plant on Earth

00:03:43.196 --> 00:03:48.036
has made its entire body
directly from carbon in the air.

00:03:49.396 --> 00:03:51.676
They’re incredible
carbon capture machines,

00:03:51.676 --> 00:03:53.676
and we’re going to need
a lot more of them.

00:03:54.076 --> 00:03:56.956
But we also have to do it right,

00:03:56.956 --> 00:04:00.116
because if you put trees
in the wrong place ...